/*
 * Implements semantic validation for class inheritance.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - validation of ancestor expressions in class declarations,
 *   - verification that the ancestor is a valid class type,
 *   - enforcement of inheritance restrictions(e.g., final classes),
 *   - installation of the ancestor into the class reference,
 *   - recursive-ancestor validation to prevent inheritance cycles,
 *   - on-demand validation of ancestor class layouts.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::class_::ancestor
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/class_/ancestor.yr
